w_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a>.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Dominated\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dominated_(Dominate_Beast)_(Condition)\" title=\"Dominated (Dominate Beast) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/ff/Dominated_Dominate_Beast_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Dominated_Dominate_Beast_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/ff/Dominated_Dominate_Beast_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Dominated_Dominate_Beast_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/ff/Dominated_Dominate_Beast_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Dominated_Dominate_Beast_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dominated\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/ff/Dominated_Dominate_Beast_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Dominated_Dominate_Beast_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/ff/Dominated_Dominate_Beast_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Dominated</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Affected entity will follow and fight alongside the caster of this spell.</li>\n<li>Every time it takes damage, it may break the caster's control over it with a successful Wisdom <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-si